# skill-composition

Apply the skill-composition skill when the request matches its scope.

Capabilities:
- declare a skill chain as producer-consumer edges
- verify artifact compatibility at each edge before execution
- run a chain inside a declared iteration and cost budget
- report per-edge handoff evidence for the chain

Stop when: Every edge in the chain passed its artifact compatibility check and the chain stayed inside its declared budget.
